// zeroboot.proto is the single gRPC contract for the whole cluster.
//
// Two services live here:
//   - NodeAgentService: served by each worker node (:50052). The controller
//     calls it to spawn, wake, and kill sandbox processes on that node.
//   - ControllerService: served by the central controller (:50051). The
//     gateway calls it to claim a sandbox for a request and release it after.
//
// Call flow for one request:
//   gateway --ClaimSandbox--> controller --ActivateSandbox--> node-agent
//   gateway --(raw TCP payload)--> sandbox on node-agent
//   gateway --ReleaseSandbox--> controller --DestroySandbox--> node-agent

